At a French Christmas market 🎄🇫🇷 Say this

• le marché de Noël = the Christmas market
• un vin chaud = a mulled wine
• un sapin = a fir / Christmas tree
• le Père Noël = Santa Claus
• joyeux Noël = Merry Christmas

🎄 Comment "Joyeux Noël !" and tell us your favourite holiday drink 👇
💌 Save this for the holidays
👯 Send it to someone who loves Christmas

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

